```

关键：container handle 必须绑定到变量，例如 `_container`，不能绑定为 `_`，否则容器会立即销毁。

## 第三方 HTTP 服务用 wiremock

支付网关、短信服务等第三方 API 无法本地运行，用 wiremock mock HTTP 响应：

```rust
use wiremock::{MockServer, Mock, ResponseTemplate};
use wiremock::matchers::{method, path};

#[tokio::test]
async fn payment_success() {
    let mock_server = MockServer::start().await;

    Mock::given(method("POST"))
        .and(path("/v1/charges"))
        .respond_with(ResponseTemplate::new(200)
            .set_body_json(serde_json::json!({"id": "ch_123", "status": "succeeded"})))
        .mount(&mock_server)
        .await;

    let service = PaymentService::new(&mock_server.uri());
    let result = service.charge(1000, "usd").await;
    assert!(result.is_ok());
}
```

## HTTP API 测试

axum API 测试使用 `tower::ServiceExt::oneshot` 做进程内 HTTP 测试：

```rust
use axum::body::Body;
use axum::http::{Request, StatusCode};
use tower::ServiceExt;

#[tokio::test]
async fn create_item_returns_201() {
    let app = build_router(state.clone());
    let req = Request::builder()
        .method("POST")
        .uri("/v1/items")
        .header("content-type", "application/json")
        .body(Body::from(r#"{"name":"test"}"#))
        .unwrap();
    let resp = app.oneshot(req).await.unwrap();
    assert_eq!(resp.status(), StatusCode::CREATED);
}
```

`oneshot` 会消费 router，每个请求需要重建 router：

```rust
let app = build_router(state.clone());
let resp1 = app.oneshot(req1).await.unwrap();

let app = build_router(state.clone());
let resp2 = app.oneshot(req2).await.unwrap();
```

## 跨 crate 测试

当测试需要多个 crate 协作，例如 agent 测试需要启动 server，在测试中启动进程内 HTTP 服务：

```rust
async fn start_server(state: Arc<AppState>) -> String {
    let app = build_router(state);
    let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind("127.0.0.1:0").await.unwrap();
    let addr = listener.local_addr().unwrap();
    tokio::spawn(async move { axum::serve(listener, app).await.unwrap() });
    format!("http://{addr}")
}
```

关键：绑定 `127.0.0.1:0` 随机端口，避免冲突。

## 依赖注入

构造器通过参数接受依赖，不在内部硬编码。这样测试可以注入 testcontainers 的端口、wiremock URL 等测试专用配置：

```rust
impl AppState {
    pub fn new(storage: Box<dyn Storage>, config: Config) -> Self { /* ... */ }
}

let state = AppState::new(Box::new(minio_storage), test_config());
let state = AppState::new(Box::new(prod_storage), prod_config());
```

反模式：构造器内部硬编码连接地址。

```rust
pub fn new() -> Self {
    let storage = S3Storage::new("localhost:9000", "admin", "pass").unwrap();
    // ...
}
```

## 错误路径

每个 API 端点测正向路径和关键错误路径：

```rust
async fn create_succeeds() { /* 201 */ }
async fn create_without_auth_rejected() { /* 401 */ }
async fn create_duplicate_rejected() { /* 409 */ }
async fn create_invalid_body_rejected() { /* 422 */ }
```

